PFX J 0 bwa .
PFX J 0 lwaa .
PFX J 0 zaa .
PFX J 0 kwaa .
PFX J 0 gaa .
PFX J 0 twa .

# Subject markers for the near future
PFX K Y 23
PFX K 0 naa .
PFX K 0 munaa
PFX K 0 onoo .
PFX K 0 onaa .
PFX K 0 anaa .
PFX K 0 tunaa .
PFX K 0 munaa .
PFX K 0 banaa .
PFX K 0 gunaa .
PFX K 0 ginaa .
