PFX L 0 zili .
PFX L 0 kuli .
PFX L 0 gali .
PFX L 0 tuli .

# Subject markers for the far future tense in reflexive verbs
# TO-DO Examine "ndibeetaaga" and ndyeetaaga to see whether "Okweetaga" exists in both reflexive and non-reflexive verbs
PFX M Y 21
PFX M 0 ndye
PFX M 0 olye .
PFX M 0 alye .
PFX M 0 tulye .
PFX M 0 mulye .
PFX M 0 balye .
