PFX M 0 bulye .
PFX M 0 lulye .
PFX M 0 zilye .
PFX M 0 kulye .
PFX M 0 galye .
PFX M 0 tulye .

# object markers
PFX F Y 19
PFX F 0 n .
PFX F l nd [l]
PFX F w mp [w]
PFX F 0 mu .
PFX F 0 ba .
PFX F 0 gu .
PFX F 0 gi .
PFX F 0 zi .
PFX F 0 ki .
PFX F 0 bi .
