PFX F 0 ga .
PFX F 0 ka .
PFX F 0 bu .
PFX F 0 lu .
PFX F 0 zi .
PFX F 0 ku .
PFX F 0 ga .
PFX F 0 tu .

# A special group of object markers in words like A"mwe"kutte Ba"gwe"wadde, Baa"ke"fumbidde
# In the .dic file, they should be implemented multiple times to cover all tenses and other cases
PFX H Y 15
PFX H 0 bee .
PFX H 0 gwe .
PFX H 0 gye .
PFX H 0 ze .
PFX H 0 kye .
PFX H 0 bye .
PFX H 0 lye .
PFX H 0 ge .
PFX H 0 ke .
PFX H 0 bwe .
PFX H 0 lwe .
PFX H 0 ze .
PFX H 0 kwe .
PFX H 0 ge .
PFX H 0 twe .

